# env.optional — fallbacks / enrichment only; the skill runs without these.
# Apify ad-library actor when Meta/Google library pages are too anti-bot for Playwright.
# If set -> Apify actor; else -> the keyless Playwright scrapers, degrading to `site:` web
# search (default):
APIFY_API_TOKEN
# Persist scraped ad history across runs for true new-vs-retired monitoring. If set ->
# Supabase store; else -> single-run in-workspace JSON, no cross-run dedup (default):
SUPABASE_URL
SUPABASE_KEY
# Optional SERP upgrade for the `site:` ad-library / archive degrade searches. If a
# DataForSEO (or Serper) key is set -> structured SERP API; else -> the agent's keyless web
# search (default):
DATAFORSEO_LOGIN
DATAFORSEO_PASSWORD
SERPER_API_KEY
# Proxy for the Playwright scrapers (Robomotion Proxy); dodges IP blocks, sets geo:
HTTPS_PROXY
